  lines:
  - speaker: "尼"
    text: "今天也收获满满呢！"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "博士"
    text: "怎么样？"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "博士"
    text: "没有出现数据错误之类的异常吧？"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "伊"
    text: "没有问题。"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "伊"
    text: "只是，我感觉身体好像多了一些东西。"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  - speaker: "尼"
    text: "是感受到情感了吗？"
    charactersPerSecond: 0
    minimumDisplaySeconds: 0
    cue: ""
  stagingNotes: "原稿第14段：第二次实验收获。句尾c为手动翻页标记，已移除；未标c的同角色连续行保留换行。尚未绑定场景触发、情感解锁或演出事件。"
